<statement>
<p>
A single die is rolled twice. Find the probability of rolling the following.</p>
<p>
(a)  One even and one odd number.</p>
<p>
<fillin characters="20"/>   </p>
<p>
(b)  Two numbers whose sum is exactly <m>\displaystyle{9}</m>.</p>
<p>
<fillin characters="20"/>   </p>
<p>
(c)  Two numbers whose sum exceeds <m>\displaystyle{11}</m>.</p>
<p>
<fillin characters="20"/>   </p>
<p>
(d)  Two numbers which are the same.</p>
<p>
<fillin characters="20"/>   

</p>
</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li><m>\displaystyle\frac{{1}}{{2}}</m></li><li><m>\displaystyle\frac{{1}}{{9}}</m></li><li><m>\displaystyle\frac{{1}}{{36}}</m></li><li><m>\displaystyle\frac{{1}}{{6}}</m></li></ul></p>
</answer>

